Tue Sep  8 11:57:11 UTC 2026 - Victor Carvalho <victor.carvalho@suse.com>

- Initial package, version 0.2.2
  https://github.com/kubevirt/virt-template/releases/tag/v0.2.2
  virt-template is the KubeVirt add-on providing VirtualMachineTemplate
  resources; KubeVirt 1.9 pins this release and virt-operator deploys
  its API server and controller when the Template feature gate is on.
  Versioned package (virt-template0.2) so that the minor a KubeVirt
  release pins can be shipped next to the next one.
  * apiserver subpackage: /usr/bin/virt-template-apiserver
  * controller subpackage: /usr/bin/virt-template-controller
  * tests subpackage: the compiled functional suite
    (/usr/bin/virt-template-tests)
- Together with the images built from it, provides the
  virt-template-apiserver and virt-template-controller containers the
  KubeVirt 1.9 manifests reference; without them virt-operator on
  Tumbleweed never reaches Available (bsc#1272604).
- The tarball is upstream v0.2.2 with its vendored Go modules updated
  (go.mod/go.sum/vendor only, no source changes): golang.org/x/net
  0.57.0, golang.org/x/crypto 0.56.0, golang.org/x/text 0.41.0,
  google.golang.org/grpc 1.83.1, go.opentelemetry.io/otel 1.44.0.
- Build with Go 1.26 (required by golang.org/x/crypto 0.56.0).
